      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I was told that that this post effect is \"Chromatic Aberration\" that should be disabled in other HMDs.\n\nI think it started after I changed the Pimax app from PiTool to Pimax Play.\n\nI suspect this is happening because the VRChat app has a mechanism to detect the HMD and disable chromatic aberration, and the VRChat app cannot detect the new Pimax Play.",
