      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "This is most likely an issue with Pimax or canted-display HMDs in general.\n\nWe already strongly recommend worlds not use the Chromatic Aberration post processing effect among others that break in VR: https://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/submitting-a-world-to-be-made-public/#performance-tips\n\nWe currently don't plan on fixing this on our end, as worlds should not use these effects in VR.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
