  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I'm using Pimax 5K Super and latest Pimax Play.\n\nRoughly since early August or later, some post-effects blur the entire field of view and make it difficult to play in some worlds. like the screen shots (some world I forgot, dreamseqs, and vending machine shed). The VRChat camera does not affected so I captured them by SteamVR screen shot.\n\nThere are several possible causes.\n\n- I updated to Pimax Play from PiTool because a vulnerability is noticed on PiTool\n\n- I updated RTX3090's Game Ready Driver\n\n- VRChat updated\n\nBut I do not know the cause.",
